== 3. Gamut policy on out-of-gamut OKLCH ==
   palette 0.7.7 exposes NO public gamut-mapping API. `Clamp` clamps
   components; the Ottosson cusp approximation exists only as the private
   `ok_utils::find_gamut_intersection`, reachable in public API only by
   round-tripping through Okhsl/Okhsv and clamping saturation by hand.

